     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Time sequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Da** places a past stage and **siden** connects an experience with the present. Clauses with **etter at** place a later action: **Etter at jeg fullførte kurset, begynte jeg å jobbe** («After I completed the course, I started working»). Order the dates before explaining reasons."
     ],
